# Hospital Patient Recovery Analysis System

This project analyses hospital patient records to understand recovery outcomes, medical conditions, treatment costs, hospital stays, readmissions and patient satisfaction.

## Business Problem

To analyse hospital data and understand patient recovery patterns and hospital performance.

## Dataset

`hospital data analysis.csv` – 984 rows and 10 columns.

The dataset includes patient age, medical condition, procedure, treatment cost, length of stay, readmission, outcome and satisfaction.

## Key Features

- Patient recovery analysis
- Medical condition analysis
- Hospital stay analysis
- Treatment cost analysis
- Readmission analysis
- Patient satisfaction analysis
- Search patient by ID
- Generate hospital report

## Technologies Used

Python · Pandas · NumPy · Google Colab · Kaggle · GitHub

## How to Run

1. Open Google Colab.
2. Upload `hospital data analysis.csv`.
3. Install libraries using `!pip install pandas numpy`.
4. Copy and run the project code.

## Conclusion

This project demonstrates how Python, Pandas and NumPy can be used to analyse hospital data and understand patient recovery patterns.

